===[[Decks]]===

* {{d|Zodiac}}, {{d|Magic}} or the {{d|Ghost}} work well for the vampire, as these decks have more opportunities to obtain Tarots and Spectral cards (see [[Vampire#Consumables|Consumables]] below) that can provide enhanced cards to feed the Vampire.
* {{d|Black}}'s additional Joker slot can be used for effect Jokers (like {{J|Midas Mask}}) to generate enhanced cards.
* {{D|Medusa}} and {{D|Monolith}} [[Challenge Decks]] both starts with a {{J|Marble Joker}}, which Vampire can use it as an enhancement generator to scale easier. Not only that, Medusa also starts with 12 {{Enhancement|Stone}}s.

===[[Poker Hands]]===
Since this joker will consume the Enhancements before they get applied, hands with a high base mult are preferred.
* {{ph|Flush Five}}
* {{ph|Flush House}}
* {{ph|Five of a Kind}}
* {{ph|Straight Flush}}
* {{ph|Full House}}
* {{ph|Flush}}
* {{ph|Four of a Kind}}

===[[Jokers]]===
