===[[Decks]]===
Any Deck synergizes well with Walkie Talkie due to its versatility. However, these have a slightly easier time using it than the others:

* {{d|Abandoned}}: Has the highest state of advantage with this Joker, due to having less cards in the Deck overall, thereby making it easier to find 10s and 4s.
* {{d|Painted}}: This Joker serves as good role compression, providing Chips and Additive Mult while taking up just 1 of the 4 Joker slots. On top of this, the increased hand size allows easier finding of higher quantities of 10s and 4s.
* {{d|Ghost}}, {{d|Magic}}, and {{d|Zodiac}}: All these have more overall access to the Deck fixing methods that this Joker loves, but they do not have a distinct consistency advantage right away like the aforementioned ones do.

===[[Poker hands]]===
Focus on these hands in the early game to consistently maximize this Joker's impact:
* {{ph|Two Pair}}
* {{ph|Three of a Kind}}
* {{ph|Full House}} (the best choice, due to having 5 scoring cards while not being substantially harder to find)

As you manipulate your Deck to include more 10s and 4s, pivot towards these hands (note that 3 of these 4 are secret hands, meaning you will not be able to level scale them right away):
* {{ph|Four of a Kind}}
* {{ph|Five of a Kind}}
* {{ph|Flush House}}
* {{ph|Flush Five}}
