===[[Decks]]===
*{{d|Abandoned}} and {{D|Mad World}} work best with Wily Joker thanks to their smaller card count.
*{{d|Erratic}} can synergize with Wily Joker if it's randomized to have lots of cards of the same rank.
*{{d|Plasma}} benefits from the large amount of chips, which, when balanced, greatly boost the score for the played hand.
===[[Poker hands]]===
Playing any hand with three cards of the same rank will trigger Wily Joker. This includes:
*{{ph|Three of a Kind}}
*{{ph|Full House}}
*{{ph|Four of a Kind}}
*{{ph|Five of a Kind}}
*{{ph|Flush House}}
*{{ph|Flush Five}}
===[[Jokers]]===
*{{j|Zany Joker}}: {{Mult|+12}} when played hand contains Three of a kind.
*{{j|The Trio}}: {{xmult|3}} when played hand contains Three of a kind.

===[[Decks]]===
* {{D|Ghost}} has several spectral cards (namely {{spectral|Ouija}}) that make deck fixing towards Three of a Kind and above much easier.
* {{D|Abandoned}} and {{D|Mad World}} both have smaller deck sizes, making Three of a Kinds much more consistent to find.
* {{D|Painted}} starts with +2 hand size, making a Three of a Kind easier to search for.
* {{D|Erratic}} can work well with Zany Joker if the seed grants a deck with many cards of the same rank.

===[[Poker hands]]===
Playing any hand with three cards of the same rank will trigger Zany Joker. This includes:
*{{ph|Three of a Kind}}
*{{ph|Full House}}
*{{ph|Four of a Kind}}
*{{ph|Five of a Kind}}
*{{ph|Flush House}}
*{{ph|Flush Five}}

===[[Jokers]]===
* {{J|Wily Joker}} gives {{Chips|+100}} when playing a Three of a Kind.
* {{J|The Trio}} gives {{Xmult|3}} when playing any hand that has a Three of a Kind, synergizing greatly with Zany Joker's flat {{Mult|+12}}.

===[[Consumables]]===
* {{Tarot|The Hanged Man}} and {{spectral|Immolate}} can cut deck size down on the size of the player's deck and make assembling a Three of a Kind much easier.
* {{Tarot|Death}} can turn cards into other cards and make Three of a Kinds more consistent to put together.
* {{spectral|Ouija}} makes all cards held in hand the same rank at the cost of reducing hand size by -1, making it easier to assemble a Three of a Kind.
